                "title": "Rope and Tassel Handle Pull",
                "description": "This highly detailed Rope and Tassel Handle Pull from First Impressions has a 7 inch center to center length and measures 17 inches overall. It is available in a wide array of finishes including satin brass, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting for wood, glass, or metal doors.",
